claim.claim-text:
receiving (S 110, S220, S310) position configuration information from a base station, wherein the position configuration information comprises a configuration status of a candidate position for transmitting a synchronization signal block;
determining (S120) valid configuration information in the position configuration information; and
determining (S130, S240, S340), according to the valid configuration information, the resource occupation position in all candidate positions in a transmission window of the synchronization signal block, wherein the candidate positions are positions for transmitting the synchronization signal block.

an information receiving module (410), configured to receive position configuration information from a base station, wherein the position configuration information comprises a configuration status of a candidate position for transmitting a synchronization signal block;
an information determining module (420), configured to determine valid configuration information in the position configuration information; and
a position determining module (430), configured to determine, according to the valid configuration information, the resource occupation position in all candidate positions in a transmission window of the synchronization signal block, wherein the candidate positions are positions for transmitting the synchronization signal block.
